# M6.4 acceptance, run 3 of 3: an unsaved project has a chat list too, but
# its chats live in memory only. Run through tests/acceptance/m6.4.sh after
# runs 1 and 2, with the same HOME; this run opens
# /tmp/agentic-reader-m6.4/loose/single.pdf, whose folder has no .reader/, so
# it opens as an unsaved project. Interface choices and the fake's replies
# are at the top of m6.4.steps. m6.4-check.py run3 checks that no .reader/
# appeared in loose/, that no file under loose/, the scratch HOME or proj/
# holds "LOOSE" or "Loose renamed" (the app's sidecar.log aside), and that
# the fake saw two new_chat, no resume_chat and the two prompts.
wait 4

# Unsaved project: the project header says "Unsaved project" with the "Save
# as project" button, the PDF pane shows single.pdf ("Page One"). The chat
# pane has the same chat list row (dropdown with one new, untitled chat or a
# placeholder, then "New chat", "Rename", "Delete"), an empty view and the
# input. None of run 1's chats (ALPHA, BRAVO, ...) is listed. No red notice.
shot unsaved-start

click 1180 800
type LOOSE one: first unsaved chat
key Return
wait 3
key alt+n
wait 2
click 1180 800
type LOOSE two: second unsaved chat
key Return
wait 3
click 1040 90
wait 1

# The list of the unsaved project, newest first: "LOOSE two: second unsaved
# chat", "LOOSE one: first unsaved chat". Nothing else.
shot unsaved-list

key Escape
wait 1
key End
wait 2

# LOOSE one selected, from memory: the dropdown reads "LOOSE one: first
# unsaved chat", the view shows that message and "Answer 1 in this session.
# You said: LOOSE one: first unsaved chat." and nothing of LOOSE two. No red
# notice.
shot unsaved-switched

key alt+r
wait 1
key ctrl+a
type Loose renamed
key Return
wait 2

# Renamed in memory: the dropdown reads "Loose renamed", the view still
# shows LOOSE one's exchange.
shot unsaved-renamed

key alt+d
wait 1
key alt+y
wait 2

# Deleted after the confirmation: "Loose renamed" is gone, LOOSE two is
# selected (the dropdown reads "LOOSE two: second unsaved chat", the view
# shows its exchange). tests/acceptance/m6.4.sh checks that this shot exists.
shot unsaved-deleted

key ctrl+q
wait 3
